From 0bb1f5577a07be404a24920b4159d1fdfc2080d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Laze ." <laze.@MacBook-Pro-50.local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:55:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in scene snapshot and fog contract for Aurora water
 depth

Capture colour and depth before translucent terrain for API water.2, preserve legacy layouts, and validate snapshot freshness and resizing on GPU.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
